      "source_utf8": "SELECT 1 AS anchor;\nBEGIN TRY\n    SELECT 1 / 0 AS boom;\nEND TRY\nBEGIN CATCH\n    THROW 50001, N'failed', 1;\nEND CATCH;\n",
